ue},{"name":"暴击率","values":[12,12],"unit":"%"},{"name":"防御","values":[33,36],"baseValues":[33.048,36.288000000000004],"grows":true}],"growthRate":1.02,"mainOptions":[{"name":"生命","min":8.0,"max":20.0,"unit":"%"},{"name":"防御","min":6.0,"max":18.0,"unit":"%"},{"name":"武器技能恢复速度","min":4.0,"max":18.0,"unit":"%"}],"subOptions":[{"name":"技能伤害值","min":5.0,"max":20.0,"unit":"%"}],"subCount":[0,1],"limitBreak":[{"name":"攻击","min":10.0,"max":10.0,"unit":"%"}],"engrave":[{"name":"攻击","min":15.0,"max":15.0,"unit":"%"},{"name":"生命","min":15.0,"max":15.0,"unit":"%"}],"engraveRandom":[{"name":"生命","unit":"%","values":[3.0,6.0,9.0,12.0,15.0]}],"effects":[{"name":"忘我之境","description":"仙山拳攻击范围增大50%，按照双拳攻击伤害值的100%恢复生命。"}],"skill":{"name":"霸王冰焰弹","description":"发射寒冰与烈火融合而成的冰焰弹，对前方敌人造成近程伤害，并附带击倒效果。","levels":[2,5],"damage":[160.0,220.0],"cooldown":[8.5,8.5],"ailment":"击倒"}}],"number":1}],"profile":{"Age":[20],"Height":[176],"Weight":[72]},"tribes":["人类"],"story":"佩儿，在消逝之都传承仙山拳法，师承神威门掌门陶禹。\n\n原是武林星河派正一门的弟子，因身份低微，遭到其他师兄弟的歧视，后离开正一门拜师陶禹。自己受了不少委屈，仍坚信人类的善良及其影响力，对善能胜恶的信念异常坚定。\n\n为了不像瞧不起自己的人一样犯错，举止有礼，慎重待人。天生为人谦虚，注重礼节。平时严肃认真、沉着冷静的态度，在见到小动物，与其搭话时变得无比亲切。认为没有人能真正理解动物们不能言语的无奈之心，待它们极为友善。","storyKey":"profile_china_boy_story","sources":{"hero":"heroes.json / OriginId=52","profile":"heroprofile.json / OriginId=52","strings":"strings-zhCN.json","items":"items.json / TargetCharacterIds, ExclusiveCharacterId","voiceLines":["strings-zhCN.json / Voice_*, cv_*","strings-enUS.json / Voice_*, cv_*","strings-jaJP.json / Voice_*, cv_*"],"voiceAudio":"gtaudio/data/offline-package.json; CharacterVoiceType; heroes.json VoiceId"},"voiceLines":[{"id":"china_hero_boy","label":"普通","lines":[{"type":"NormalBattleWin","label":"胜利-普通战斗","texts":{"zhCN":["真正的侠义永不言败…"],"enUS":["True warriors never lose."],"jaJP":["真の漢とは、負けを知らぬものだ"]},"keys":["cv_china_hero_boy_NormalBattleWin"],"audio":{"zhCN":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/ondemand/voices_cn/52/520001@-1479861991380003028"],"enUS":["cdn/Android/ondemand/voices_en/52/520001"